      "snippet": "- Review daily-intel-brief build_pdf.py if concerned about env exposure to subprocesses ## Daily Intel Brief — Cron Setup - **Pipeline:** `scripts/daily-brief-cron.sh` — runs orchestrate.py (collect → analyze → visuals → PDF) then delivers via Gmail - **Schedule:** OpenClaw cron at 05:00 PT → triggers isolated session → executes script - **Delivery:** Gmail API via Maton gateway → `roderick.jones@gmail.com` — arrives ~07:00 PT - **Script handles:** orchestrator failures (sends failure notification to Roderick), PDF delivery with HTML summary + PDF attachment - **Cron job ID:** `250765ae-d951-490c-b3d0-109fca300053` - **Cron expression:** `0 5 * * *` @ `America/Los_Angeles` (5am PT daily) -",
