      "snippet": "- v5-v6: Mapbox dark-v11/light-v11 with GeoJSON (user: \"no change in this version!\") - v7-v8: Mapbox hybrid + PIL overlays with Economist style (user: \"no change!\") - v9: Pure PIL with cream bg, no Mapbox dependency — lat/lon swap bug found, markers rendered off-screen at negative coords ### Root cause of map failures - **Projection math was wrong** for at least 3 versions. `cfg[\"center\"]` stored as `(lat, lon)` but projection code treated it as `(lon, lat)`, putting all markers off-screen - Static GeoJSON data (same cities/routes every day) didn't adapt to daily content - Mapbox Static API had no typography control (GeoJSON labels rendered at fixed small sizes) - User wanted Economis",
