      "source": "memory",
      "snippet": "**Architecture note:** The LLM slow path fails in ad-hoc shell environments because `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY` is injected by OpenClaw at runtime, not present in subprocess shells. The keyword fast path handles all common cases. On API failure, defaults permissively to `in_scope`. Pipeline workers (analyze.py, orchestrate.py) have the key available in cron environment. ### Framework Generalization Note The scope gate is framework-general. Only `analyst/config/scope.yaml` needs to change for redirection: update `primary_scope`, `scope_descriptor`, `themes`, `adjacency_vectors`, and keyword lists. The `scope_check.py` module, `build_decline()`, and three-branch flow are topic-agnostic. This closes",
